irst-flight-note\"></p>\n    <p id=\"flight-count\"></p>\n    <p>Fuel: <span id=\"fuel-start\">100</span> units, burning <span id=\"burn-rate\">15</span> a minute</p>\n    <p id=\"fuel\"></p>\n    <p id=\"first-delay\"></p>\n    <p id=\"active-count\"></p>\n    <p id=\"next-flight\"></p>\n    <p id=\"destinations\"></p>\n    <p id=\"on-time\"></p>\n    <p id=\"last-departure\"></p>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
